The per-poll raw files of this run were overwritten by run 2 (same file names); the summary
above is the script's printed output. Reading: the same mean at every rate (88.2 / 87.9 /
87.8 %), a little more sample-to-sample scatter at 0.1 s (82-94 % against 86-90 % at 0.5 s),
no dropouts; the first busy poll is a partial window (23 / 10 / 29 %). The period, however,
